            "description": {
              "value": "With a single whisper carried on the wind, you enchant your ammunition to make a foe more vulnerable to your attacks.\n\nMake a bow Strike. On a hit, the target takes an additional 2d6 mental damage. On a critical hit, the target also becomes stunned 1. The mental damage increases to 3d6 if your bow has a greater striking rune, or to 4d6 if your bow has a major striking rune."
